<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" http-equiv="Content-Type" />
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        background-color: #f4f4f4;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }
      .container {
        width: 80%;
        margin: auto;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        padding: 20px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      }
      .header {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 10px 0;
      }
      .header h1 {
        color: #333333;
      }
      .content {
        margin: 20px 0;
      }
      .content p {
        color: #666666;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
      .footer {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 10px 0;
        color: #999999;
        font-size: 12px;
      }
      .contact {
        margin-top: 20px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .contact p {
        color: #666666;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <h1>Welcome to <%= @membership.lounge.name %>, <%= @membership.first_name %>!</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="content">
        <p>
          We are thrilled to have you as a part of our community! As a member of <%= @membership.lounge.name %>, you now have access to exclusive events, special offers, and a welcoming environment to relax and connect with others.
        </p>
        <p>
          Here are some details about your membership:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Name:</strong> <%= @membership.first_name %> <%= @membership.last_name %></li>
          <li><strong>Email:</strong> <%= @membership.email.presence || 'Not provided' %></li>
          <li><strong>Phone Number:</strong> <%= @membership.phone_number.presence || 'Not provided' %></li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Stay tuned for updates on upcoming events and special offers. We look forward to seeing you at <%= @membership.lounge.name %> soon!
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="contact">
        <p>If you have any questions, feel free to contact us at <%= @membership.lounge.email %> or call us at <%= format_phone_number(@membership.lounge.phone_number) %>.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="footer">
        <p>Thank you for joining us!</p>
        <p><%= @membership.lounge.name %> Team</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>